#: ../../source/docs/sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loop.rst:5
#: 33533fee733e4b18977ff1ad223e9690
msgid "SITL Simulator (Software in the Loop)"
msgstr "SITL 仿真器（软件在环）"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loop.rst:9
#: 581dad79ed3e4a88b1b48e5876ec9423
msgid ""
"The SITL (software in the loop) simulator allows you to run Plane, Copter or"
" Rover without any hardware. It is a build of the autopilot code using an "
"ordinary C++ compiler, giving you a native executable that allows you to "
"test the behaviour of the code without hardware."
msgstr ""
"SITL（软件在环）仿真器允许您在无需任何硬件的情况下运行 Plane、Copter 或 Rover。它使用普通的 C++ "
"编译器对自动驾驶仪代码进行构建，生成本地可执行文件，让您无需硬件即可测试代码的行为。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loop.rst:14
#: dee3528853c147759bf6fc37d053b937
msgid "This article provides an overview of SITL's benefits and architecture."
msgstr "本文概述了 SITL 的优势和架构。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loop.rst:17
#: c9d44cf240464622aa804cde5d0683d9
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loop.rst:19
#: 0dd8894808cd480a9dc3c696bce4ad1a
msgid ""
"SITL allows you to run ArduPilot on your PC directly, without any special "
"hardware. It takes advantage of the fact that ArduPilot is a portable "
"autopilot that can run on a very wide variety of platforms. Your PC is just "
"another platform that ArduPilot can be built and run on."
msgstr ""
"SITL 允许您直接在 PC 上运行 ArduPilot，无需任何特殊硬件。它利用了 ArduPilot "
"是一个可在各种平台上运行的可移植自动驾驶仪这一特点。您的 PC 只是另一个可以构建和运行 ArduPilot 的平台。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loop.rst:24
#: 5a129d559595453392b7457b20fcb5cc
msgid ""
"When running in SITL the sensor data comes from a flight dynamics model in a"
" flight simulator. ArduPilot has a wide range of vehicle simulators built "
"in, and can interface to several external simulators. This allows ArduPilot "
"to be tested on a very wide variety of vehicle types. For example, SITL can "
"simulate:"
msgstr ""
"在 SITL 中运行时，传感器数据来自飞行仿真器中的飞行动力学模型。ArduPilot "
"内置了各种飞行器仿真器，并可与多个外部仿真器对接，从而允许在各种飞行器类型上对 ArduPilot 进行测试。例如，SITL 可以仿真："

