#: 76d87489ead94fbab2d4eab987b5890a
msgid "multi-rotor aircraft"
msgstr "多旋翼飞行器"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loop.rst:31
#: 3af83e6647484276adedddeda8854c78
msgid "fixed wing aircraft"
msgstr "固定翼飞行器"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loop.rst:32
#: 25c367cda866484fbbd11e552031be79
msgid "ground vehicles"
msgstr "地面飞行器"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loop.rst:33
#: 4b5a7cabfc474bc692be153ac8c2e49e
msgid "underwater vehicles"
msgstr "水下飞行器"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loop.rst:34
#: 3c06d5f61ab1497183aba794826a9aa5
msgid "camera gimbals"
msgstr "相机云台"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loop.rst:35
#: 0ef8f6a144024c7095b4a3f21bdf2c2c
msgid "antenna trackers"
msgstr "天线追踪器"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loop.rst:36
#: 50e2ae31bb4b428493faf6498eb83156
msgid ""
"a wide variety of optional sensors, such as Lidars and optical flow sensors"
msgstr "各种可选传感器，如激光雷达和光流传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loop.rst:39
#: 90ad8a4b337442dc96b083be0402f4e6
msgid "Adding new simulated vehicle types or sensor types is straightforward."
msgstr "添加新的仿真飞行器类型或传感器类型非常简单。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loop.rst:41
#: ad49b91f080e42e5afbccba68cf9b67d
msgid ""
"A big advantage of ArduPilot on SITL is it gives you access to the full "
"range of development tools available to desktop C++ development, such as "
"interactive debuggers, static analyzers and dynamic analysis tools. This "
"makes developing and testing new features in ArduPilot much simpler."
msgstr ""
"在 SITL 上运行 ArduPilot 的一大优势是，您可以使用桌面 C++ "
"开发中所有可用的开发工具，如交互式调试器、静态分析器和动态分析工具。这使得在 ArduPilot 中开发和测试新功能变得更加简单。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loop.rst:47
#: 74014bf7c6664204843c2bff0acda034
msgid "Running SITL"
msgstr "运行 SITL"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loop.rst:49
#: bf597d8527bc4df1b1495ef14cc43fb1
msgid ""
"The ArduPilot SITL environment has been developed to run natively on both "
"Linux and Windows. For setup instructions see :ref:`Setting Up SITL <SITL-"
"setup-landingpage>` for more information. Using SITL is explained in "
":ref:`Using SITL <using-sitl-for-ardupilot-testing>`. For examples of "
"starting and using SITL for a particular vehicle see :ref:`sitl-examples`."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot SITL 环境已开发为可在 Linux 和 Windows 上原生运行。设置说明请参阅 :ref:`设置 SITL <SITL-"
"setup-landingpage>`。SITL 的使用在 :ref:`使用 SITL <using-sitl-for-ardupilot-"
"testing>` 中进行了说明。关于特定飞行器启动和使用 SITL 的示例，请参阅 :ref:`sitl-examples`。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loop.rst:53
#: 671a22f692f542d7ba48f4b455755f72
msgid ""
"Mission Planner (Windows) also provides a simple means of running SITL for "
"the master branch and stable branches of vehicles. See "
":ref:`planner:mission-planner-simulation`."
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner（Windows）也提供了一种简单的方式来运行 master 分支和稳定分支飞行器的 SITL。请参阅 "
":ref:`planner:mission-planner-simulation`。"

